cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the paper (preferred-citation below) and,
  where the exact computational artifact matters, the archived snapshot DOI.
title: >-
  Reproduction code for "Fast covariance-free spatiotemporal modeling via
  coarse-to-fine learning"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained code and per-replicate results reproducing every table in the
  Monte Carlo section and the appendices of Murakami (2026): Tables 1-6 and
  Tables A1-A3. CF-STM (cf_dglm) is included as standalone R and C++ source, so
  no installed spCF package is required.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-06"
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
authors:
